    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA McGee are delighted to present No. 18 Parkwood Avenue, a beautifully presented three-bedroom home to the market.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 87 sq. m., this attractive property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, making it an excellent choice for first-time buyers, families, or those looking for a comfortable home in a well-established and convenient location.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a bright and inviting entrance hall which leads through to a generous sized living room, providing an ideal space for relaxing and entertaining. To the rear lies the kitchen and dining area, offering excellent space for everyday family living. Upstairs, the property comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nNo. 18 Parkwood Avenue is presented to the market in excellent condition throughout and offers a wonderful opportunity to acquire a well-located family home.\r\n\r\nParkwood Avenue is a mature residential estate in Tallaght, Dublin 24, offering residents an excellent balance of convenience and accessibility. The surrounding area provides a wealth of amenities, including a selection of schools, shops, cafés, bars, restaurants and recreational facilities, all within easy reach. Tallaght also benefits from excellent transport links, with a range of bus services and the Luas Red Line providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. The location also offers easy access to the N81, M50 and wider road network, making it particularly appealing to commuters."
      },
